One year we had to put $40,000 in for a revaluation, but we didn't need it the following year.

746
00:36:10,380 --> 00:36:12,340
Went to default the following year.

747
00:36:12,340 --> 00:36:18,620
That was taken out as the default budget was created because you're supposed to remove the things that you know you don't need.

748
00:36:19,240 --> 00:36:24,380
If you have a position that today is not filled and you are not going to ever fill that position any longer,

749
00:36:24,540 --> 00:36:27,060
you should be removing that from your default budget number.

750
00:36:28,720 --> 00:36:29,120
Okay.

751
