1597
01:10:40,540 --> 01:10:41,800
It's just we're getting a new machine.

1598
01:10:42,080 --> 01:10:42,320
Yep.

1599
01:10:42,400 --> 01:10:43,300
For 60 months.

1600
01:10:43,480 --> 01:10:43,960
