1604
01:10:51,880 --> 01:10:53,060
Yeah, I think it's called a mail machine.

1605
01:10:54,220 --> 01:10:56,060
NASPO value point.

1606
01:10:58,220 --> 01:11:03,500
Yeah, it looks like that.

1607
01:11:03,660 --> 01:11:03,880
Yep.

1608
01:11:04,460 --> 01:11:04,700
Yep.

1609
01:11:05,060 --> 01:11:05,340
Okay.

1610
