Audient leasing for 60 months for $166.24 a month.

1612
01:11:22,220 --> 01:11:22,720
All right.

1613
01:11:22,740 --> 01:11:23,260
Do I have a second?

1614
01:11:23,440 --> 01:11:24,100
Second by Eddie.

1615
01:11:24,300 --> 01:11:25,260
All in favor say aye.

1616
01:11:25,660 --> 01:11:25,920
Aye.

1617
01:11:26,020 --> 01:11:26,220
Aye.

1618
01:11:27,500 --> 01:11:27,940
Okay.

1619
01:11:28,560 --> 01:11:29,640
Thank you so much.

1620
01:11:32,520 --> 01:11:33,060
All right.

