I'll make a motion to appoint Diane, I don't know why I just blanked on her name, sorry.

1655
01:13:18,720 --> 01:13:22,440
Diane Romnick for the alternate for the zoning board.

1656
01:13:23,840 --> 01:13:24,940
For a term of three years.

1657
01:13:24,940 --> 01:13:25,980
For a term of three years.

1658
